# Spirit of the Labyrinth and Laboratory Maniac, both Bot1's: "if a replacement effect would try to replace a card that you
# can't draw, that effect can't apply" (Spirit's ruling; CR 614.17c). Bot1's library holds one card as Ancestral Recall
# resolves: the first draw takes it; the second would be from the empty library, but it is the turn's second card, which
# Bot1 can't draw - so Laboratory Maniac does not replace it and Bot1 does not win, and having drawn nothing from the empty
# library, Bot1 does not lose either (CR 121.4, 704.5b). Nor does the third draw.

